{"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.029845634186852266,"x":0.83087365859378715,"t":"Reading","w":0.08518165588378912,"h":0.02003311408843822,"c":1},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.17901234944661454,"x":0.076131685256116577,"y":0.079799764537743512,"c":1,"t":"Questions 21-24"},{"w":0.25336840311686198,"h":0.016874542505918022,"c":1,"x":0.075957986492828866,"y":0.11436743966280738,"t":"Complete the notes below."},{"w":0.59876541137695305,"y":0.14958775025177706,"c":1,"h":0.017667844522968212,"x":0.076131697485123148,"t":"Choose ONE WORD ONLY from the passage for each answer."},{"x":0.076131693580608437,"t":"Write your answers in boxes 21-24 on your answer sheet.","w":0.55144032796223963,"h":0.01744185965530165,"c":1,"y":0.18459302344269801},{"y":0.22345346188183501,"c":1,"t":"The Step Pyramid of Djoser","w":0.38712743123372395,"h":0.025923056091380459,"x":0.30233801681722128},{"t":"The complex that includes the Step Pyramid and its surroundings is considered to be","w":0.80259709676106772,"h":0.020746005297549663,"x":0.092537756769648455,"y":0.26846418390887905,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.092592592022918432,"t":"as big as an Egyptian 21 ....","y":0.2921083629937119,"w":0.25308642069498699,"h":0.016031172025610885},{"x":0.46502058683552888,"y":0.2891637222125707,"t":"......f the past. The area outside the pyramid","w":0.43209874471028648,"c":1,"h":0.020429301177655068},{"w":0.48353907267252599,"t":"included accommodation that was occupied by 22.","h":0.017496644818740692,"x":0.090534990319225225,"c":1,"y":0.31389870417101418},{"x":0.7304526750537923,"w":0.1234567896525065,"y":0.31242638435289871,"t":"., along with","h":0.01896896407236337,"c":1},{"y":0.33568904592751325,"t":"many other buildings and features.","w":0.33127571105957032,"h":0.016195524146054296,"c":1,"x":0.09259259703651565},{"w":0.78806584676106783,"y":0.37499999985355703,"h":0.016048292108362783,"t":"A wall ran around the outside of the complex and a number of false entrances were","x":0.090534977719114423,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.34773661295572916,"x":0.092592598763188691,"y":0.3968023254191374,"t":"built into this. In addition, a long 23 ...","h":0.017508628652008751},{"y":0.39577499876374866,"t":"... encircled the wall. As a result,","x":0.58017352545904954,"w":0.3026991526285806,"h":0.018531402794576213,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"any visitors who had not been invited were cleverly prevented from entering the","w":0.75113876342773445,"y":0.41739272780036041,"x":0.09253202227073444,"h":0.018724016362562157},{"h":0.01876691541907638,"c":1,"w":0.40966443379720047,"x":0.092465467523651632,"t":"pyramid grounds unless they knew the 24...","y":0.44029762801451899},{"x":0.64806243827589904,"h":0.017168101770156041,"w":0.21016986846923824,"y":0.44077141244586326,"t":"... of the real entrance.","c":1},{"w":0.17695472717285157,"t":"Questions 25-26","h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"x":0.076131689809875475,"y":0.51737338055638316},{"y":0.55377906960337497,"h":0.017481236631934904,"t":"Choose TWO letters, A-E.","x":0.076131682113854418,"w":0.25514404296875004,"c":1},{"x":0.076131676464358838,"w":0.62551442464192708,"t":"Write the correct letters in boxes 25 and 26 on your answer sheet.","h":0.017470964694612956,"c":1,"y":0.58863368662200921},{"t":"Which TWO of the following points does the writer make about King Djoser?","x":0.074074082744068806,"h":0.017501780506578912,"y":0.62354651146820228,"w":0.72016459147135414,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Initially he had to be persuaded to build in stone rather than clay.","x":0.16255145571891888,"w":0.61934153238932299,"y":0.65106007043165182,"h":0.017667844522968212},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"y":0.67005813930831837,"x":0.12139917698921235,"t":"B","w":0.016460905075073251},{"c":1,"h":0.013081394460653373,"x":0.12139917698921235,"w":0.016460905075073251,"y":0.68750000028057445,"t":"C"},{"t":"D","x":0.12139917698921235,"y":0.70639534863581788,"w":0.016460905075073251,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1},{"t":"There is disagreement concerning the length of his reign.","x":0.16872427313611998,"h":0.017496644818740581,"y":0.66860465100169197,"w":0.54320988972981765,"c":1},{"y":0.68749999985387855,"t":"He failed to appreciate Imhotep's part in the design of the Step Pyramid.","w":0.68312759399414069,"h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.16872426874272653,"c":1},{"t":"A few of his possessions were still in his tomb when archaeologists found it.","w":0.71810699462890626,"c":1,"x":0.16666666718833142,"y":0.70494186031904604,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"w":0.64814814249674479,"x":0.16666666915417561,"y":0.72232037668269289,"h":0.01750520486011653,"c":1,"t":"He criticised the design and construction of other pyramids in Egypt."},{"c":1,"w":0.018518517812093127,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.73251028830331566,"y":0.90843023238097287,"t":"→"},{"h":0.015045443468576947,"t":"• p. 122","x":0.75506843408447388,"y":0.90672146429482969,"w":0.096859016418456956,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.02880658467610675,"x":0.88683127546030049,"y":0.90697674401398698,"t":"23","h":0.013081395583944722}],"h":3396}